# Console pictures (Connection Method)

The logos the Connection Method rows wear (`PLAY_FROM` in
`sections/02-play-setup.js`, drawn by `consolePic`): the new-config wizard's
console step, Overview's Connection Method box and its panel. A `{light, dark}`
pair is a single-colour mark in two inks: `*-ink-dark.webp` (ink #15161a) is
drawn on the light theme, `*-ink-light.webp` (ink #eff1f3) on the dark theme.
Each file is 128 x 128, the mark contained in 120 x 120 and centred, lossless
WebP. These pictures live in the app only; no image bytes go to the Core (D120).

